msgid ""
"kmix: You do not have permission to access the mixer device.\n"
"Login as root and do a 'chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*' to allow the access."
msgstr ""
"KMix: nun tienes permisos p'acceder al preséu entemecedor.\n"
"Entra como superusuariu y fai un «chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*» pa permitir "
"l'accesu."

#: backends/mixer_oss.cpp:234
msgid ""
"kmix: Mixer cannot be found.\n"
"Please check that the soundcard is installed and the\n"
"soundcard driver is loaded.\n"
"On Linux you might need to use 'insmod' to load the driver.\n"
"Use 'soundon' when using commercial OSS."
msgstr ""
"KMix: nun pudo alcontrase l'entemecedor.\n"
"Compruebe que la tarxeta de soníu ta instalada y el \n"
"controlador de soníu ta cargáu.\n"
"En Linux, puede necesitar usar «insmod» pa cargar el controlador.\n"
"Use «soundon» si ta usando la versión comercial de OSS."

